From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 03:25:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 148/488] soh: rename func_80A9CB18 -> EnKz_UpdateTextId

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: selects King Zora's dialogue by trade-quest and tunic state, assigning actor.textId and mirroring it onto the player. Called every frame from EnKz_Update except while the timer action runs. Named to match the file's EnKz_UpdateTalkState / EnKz_UpdateEyes.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kz/z_en_kz.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kz/z_en_kz.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kz/z_en_kz.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kz/z_en_kz.c
index dd1a69d97..ac6bc6671 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kz/z_en_kz.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kz/z_en_kz.c
@@ -264,7 +264,8 @@ s32 EnKz_UpdateTalking(PlayState* play, EnKz* this, s16* talkState, f32 interact
     return false;
 }
 
-void func_80A9CB18(EnKz* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A9CB18: selects King Zora's dialogue by trade-quest and tunic state, assigning actor.textId and mirroring it onto the player. Called every frame from EnKz_Update except while the timer action runs. Named to match the file's EnKz_UpdateTalkState / EnKz_UpdateEyes.
+void EnKz_UpdateTextId(EnKz* this, PlayState* play) {
     Player* player = GET_PLAYER(play);
 
     if (EnKz_UpdateTalking(play, this, &this->interactInfo.talkState, 340.0f, EnKz_GetTextId, EnKz_UpdateTalkState)) {
@@ -518,7 +519,7 @@ void EnKz_Update(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     EnKz_UpdateEyes(this);
     Actor_MoveXZGravity(&this->actor);
     if (this->actionFunc != EnKz_StartTimer) {
-        func_80A9CB18(this, play);
+        EnKz_UpdateTextId(this, play);  // was func_80A9CB18 [LLM:HIGH]
     }
     this->actionFunc(this, play);
 }
